# trading-agent

Layout (do not invent another):

- Host MFE: `web-app/ui/spog`
- Remote MFEs: `web-app/ui/mfe-<name>`
- Shared Stitch kit: `web-app/shared-components` (`@trading-agent/shared-components`)
- Design system spec (Stitch tokens, light/dark, colour rules): `docs/design-system/`
- Microservices: `services/svc-<name>`
- Keycloak: `auth/`

Every MFE and service package root must include `README.md`, `Makefile` (`build`, `test`, `run`, `docker`), and `Dockerfile`.

Delegate:

- New MFE / spog → subagent `mfe-creator`
- Screens, components, theme, CSS → subagent `ui-developer`
- React/TypeScript standards → subagent `react`
- New microservice → subagent `svc-creator`

Node 22 (`nvm use 22`). Public npm only.

Git: never `git commit` / `git push` / history-changing git (incl. `scripts/push_via_api.py`) without the user's explicit permission in the current request. Finishing a task is not permission — leave changes uncommitted, summarise them, and ask.
